你忘了汉堡包了。
You forgot my Titanic Burger.

189
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:42,650
噢，对，请你稍等一会。
Right. You're right. Be right with you in just a ...

190
00:08:42,650 --> 00:08:45,680
业余水平。
Amateurs.

191
00:08:55,030 --> 00:08:57,430
好了，一份疯狂的房子不要胡桃，
Ok. That's one Mad House no nuts

192
