两杯冰茶，一杯"呼啊"，一杯极大不放冰，
two ice teas,one Woo,one colossal no ice

194
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:06,040
一份冰淇淋，核爆炸式的。
one patti melt-down with nuclear dressing.

195
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,770
周围散落的是薯条。
Fries on the side

196
00:09:07,770 --> 00:09:10,390
我知道，我没看错。
I knew it was right,...Look at him go.

197
00:09:10,390 --> 00:09:12,360
核爆冰淇淋？
Patti melt-down

198
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:16,200
我赌五美元，他会找错钱的。
I'll bet five dollars he messes up to change.

199
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,540
我也愿意和你睹。
I'll take that action.

200
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:21,980
9和10块，谢谢。希望你们下次再来
Nine and ten. Thank you and as we say at WOB,

201
00:09:22,930 --> 00:09:27,400
光顾本店。呵呵，
don't get any onion. O!

202
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,520
你们全家都来光临了？
What a charming little family here.

203
00:09:29,620 --> 00:09:31,940
欢迎来汉堡包房，请问要点什么？
Welcome to the World of Burgers! How may I help you?

204
00:09:32,020 --> 00:09:33,120
我们只是看看。
Well,we just came to look.

205
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:35,600
来了不吃怎么行？
Well,you got to order something,Dad.

206
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,920
好吧，就来烤羊肉串。
Ok. I'll take a meal on a stick...

207
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:39,380
不，不行。不准吃垃圾食品。
No,you don't. No junk food.

208
00:09:42,870 --> 00:09:45,290
妈妈。
Mom…

209
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:49,700
家里已经烧好晚饭了，
We had a nice dinner already at home.

210
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:51,700
我不希望他脂肪吃得太多。
I don't want him loading up on grease.

211
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:58,880
不管吃不吃都会让他丢饭碗的。
Double or nothing,he's out of here in 10 minutes.

212
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:02,640
Mike，你可是咱们家出的第一位明星职工。
Mike,we've just never have an employee of the month in our family.

213
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:06,200
我们只是想来看看你是怎么工作的。
We just came down to see you work.

214
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:08,380
我一向很喜欢穿制服的人。
I've always been a sucker for a man in uniform.

215
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:12,020
真的吗？
Yeah,you have?

216
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:14,120
我们有样东西想要你惊喜一下。
Mike,we have a little surprise for you.

217
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,500
噢，小惊喜。
Oh,a little surprise.

218
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:18,240
反正你一下班，就直接回家。
Anyway. Be sure you come straight home after work. OK?

219
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:20,660
好的。
Ok.

220
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:22,980
HI，我是经理，有什么问题？
Hi! I'm the manager. Is there a problem here?

221
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:26,000
不，这什么问题也没有。今天我在这吃早饭，
No,none whatsoever. I was down here for breakfast this morning,

222
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:28,740
这位小伙子的服务态度太好了，
and this young man gave me such incredible service.

223
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:30,800
所以我想把全家带来和他见见面，
I just wanted to bring the whole family down to meet him in person.

224
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,800
好了，孩子们，咱们走吧。
So kids,we'd better be going.

225
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:40,560
但是，你们要记住这一天。永远。
But,I want you to remember this day,always.

226
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:51,620
Mike，我不知道该怎么办，
Mike,I don't know what to do.

227
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,480
这人想要多要番茄酱。
This guy wants extra ketchup.

228
00:10:55,020 --> 00:10:56,700
我想劝他别了。
I tried to talk him out of it.

229
00:10:57,210 --> 00:10:58,840
听着Terry，你用不着紧张。
Terry,Terry,would you just relax.

230
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:02,080
没法不紧张，我要是搞糟了活儿就没了。
I can't relax. Mike,if I mess up again I'm out of here?

231
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,320
你放心。不会丢的。
You're not gonna mess up,Ok?

232
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:08,240
Terry，你收钱的抽屉还开着！
Terry! Your register draw is open!

233
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,620
是这样的，史古特，都是我的错
Ah,look,Scooter. That's my fault.

234
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:13,780
刚她休息完，她不在，
Since you just came back from a break

235
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:15,860
两个抽屉都是由我在管。
and I was handling both registers while she was gone.

236
00:11:16,770 --> 00:11:20,990
Mike？我不能相信你是本月的明星职工。
Mike? I,I,I don't believe it! You're the employee of the month!

237
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,880
对不起，
Yeah,look,I'm sorry. Scooter,look,

238
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:23,820
我要吸取教训，
I have learned my lesson,

239
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,800
你听我的心跳，每分钟能跑一英里。
my heart is just beating a mile a minute here.

240
00:11:29,530 --> 00:11:32,930
Mike，你真肯帮助人。
Huh,Mike. That was so nice of you.

241
00:11:32,930 --> 00:11:35,580
如果你要我为你效劳的话，
If there is ever anything I could ever do for you,

242
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:36,760
你就直说好了。
don't hesitate to ask,Ok?

243
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:40,980
呃呃，这个嘛。
Well…

244
00:11:40,980 --> 00:11:42,640
Mike!

245
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:42,740
Mike

246
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:43,810
史古特？
Oh,yes,Scooter!

247
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:46,480
现金账上怎么少了三十七美元？
This cash register is 37 dollars short!

248
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:50,960
我，我不知道该说什么。
I,I,I,I just don't know what to say.

249
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:53,580
请你相信我，这事绝对不会再发生。
Look,Scooter,I'm sorry. It will not happen again.

250
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:55,120
知道了。
I know.

251
00:11:56,220 --> 00:11:57,240
什么意思？
What does that mean?

252
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:02,780
对不起，我也没有办法，你被解雇了。
I'm sorry. My hands are tied. You,you're fired.

253
00:12:16,010 --> 00:12:23,280
解雇了！妈妈，爸爸？
Ah,fired! Mom,Dad?

254
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:26,930
爸爸出什么事了？
Dad something's happened today?

255
00:12:29,770 --> 00:12:32,990
惊喜！
Surprise!

256
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:37,470
这点小礼物是送给明星职工的。
A little something for our employee of the month.

257
00:12:37,470 --> 00:12:39,630
我真为你自豪。
Mike,we're so proud of you!

258
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,860
Mike坐在驾驶盘后面，
Mike's still sitting there behind the wheel

259
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:48,280
一直张着嘴巴。
with his mouth hanging wide open.

260
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:50,260
他还在流口水。
Has he start drooling yet?

261
00:12:50,860 --> 00:12:53,420
Carol，你还是少开点玩笑吧
Carol,if you'd stop making fun for one second,

262
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,520
应该学学你哥哥的榜样。
you might learn from your brother's example.

263
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:58,040
要我把Mike做榜样？
I might learn from Mike?

264
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:01,760
对，他的学业有进步，打工的表现也很好。
Yes,his grades are up,he's doing very well at the job.

265
00:13:01,980 --> 00:13:03,520
他没有把钱浪费在买录音带上
And instead of wasting his money on Scritty Polity records

266
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:05,940
而几乎全都攒了下来。
he saved almost all of it.

267
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,960
我每门功课都是优，家务全是我做的，
I have straight A's,I do all my chores around here

268
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:10,820
我宁愿死也不去买波尼迪的录音带。
and I'd sooner kill than spend a nickel on Scritty Polity

269
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:15,000
你从来就是个好孩子。
But you have always been a good kid.

270
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,360
这也是我的过错吗？
That's my crime?

271
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:22,050
Carol，我们是说像你这样一个模范孩子
Oh,Carol. What we're saying is that even a model child like you

272
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,700
也能从Mike的进步中得到教育。
can learn something from Mike's accomplishment.

273
00:13:24,700 --> 00:13:27,770
你们的意思是说哪怕我调皮捣蛋一辈子，
So if I'd spent my whole life as a total screw up,

274
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,960
但只要干一件好事，
and then did just one thing right,

275
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:33,500
也能赏我一辆汽车？
I'd be given a car too.

276
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:40,250
招聘国际化妆品公司销售代表，
Wanted sales representative for international cosmetic firm.

277
00:13:40,250 --> 00:13:43,370
诚聘有朝气有抱负青年。
Looking for young aggressive self-starter.

278
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:46,060
每月薪金六千美元，
Interested in 6,000 a month minimum,

279
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:50,260
擅长土耳其语！都有门槛！
is fluent in Turkish. Always a catch!

280
00:13:53,940 --> 00:13:55,960
带我去迪斯尼世界，快踩油门。
Take me to Disney World,step on it!

281
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,600
我倒要踩你了！
I'm gonna step on you!

282
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,700
你这样可不像个有责任的新Mike。
You don't look like a new responsible Mike.

283
00:14:02,340 --> 00:14:03,280
新这样讲？
Who said that?

284
00:14:03,660 --> 00:14:06,500
爸爸在回家的路上讲的，当时妈妈都哭了。
Dad did on the way home from World of Burgers,and mom was crying.

285
00:14:06,500 --> 00:14:08,710
哭了？
Crying?

286
00:14:08,710 --> 00:14:11,390
就象Carol进尖子班那样。
Well,like she did when Carol joined Mensa.

287
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:16,600
还是爸爸妈妈认为我没出息的日子好过得多。
You know,life was a lot better when mom and dad thought I was garbage.

288
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,590
那我还认为你没出息。
I think you're garbage,Mike.

289
00:14:18,590 --> 00:14:20,990
谢谢你。
Thanks.

290
00:14:20,990 --> 00:14:22,810
能呆会吗？
Can I stay?

291
00:14:22,810 --> 00:14:24,830
干嘛不行？
Why not?

292
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:26,550
想知道这辆车的价格吗？
You wanna know how much the car cost?

293
00:14:26,550 --> 00:14:27,620
不。
No.

294
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:30,240
一共花了2605美元！
2,605 dollars!

295
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,080
Ben!

296
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:31,180
Ben!

297
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:34,220
还要加税款，执照费和佣金……
Plus tax,license and dealer prep.

298
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:36,300
要是你再说一句他们为我自豪的话，
Look,if you say one more word of how proud they are of me,

299
00:14:36,300 --> 00:14:37,580
你就给我离开这！
you gonna have to leave.

300
00:14:37,580 --> 00:14:39,310
好吧！
Ok.

301
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:43,660
可我并没有要他们信任我，对不对？
I,I didn't ask them to have faith in me,did I,right?

302
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:44,280
有还是没有？
Yes or no?

303
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:44,830
没有。
Um,no.

304
00:14:45,740 --> 00:14:45,850
说得很好。
That's right.

305
00:14:45,850 --> 00:14:46,720
那好。
Good.

306
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:49,400
他们也应该估计到我会把事情搞糟的。
They should know I'm gonna find a way to mess things up,right?

307
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:50,370
到底怎么回事?
What's the problem?

308
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:51,750
你搞糟了？
You messed up?

309
00:14:51,750 --> 00:14:53,310
没有。
No!

310
00:14:53,310 --> 00:14:54,330
噢。
Oh.

311
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:58,320
可我并不想进去让他们伤心。
I mean. I'm not about to go in there and break their little hearts.

312
00:14:58,560 --> 00:14:59,330
我不能干那样的事，对不对？
I can't do something like that. Can I,Ben?

313
00:14:59,330 --> 00:15:00,330
当然
Sure.

314
00:15:00,330 --> 00:15:01,290
是不能。
No!

315
00:15:01,290 --> 00:15:02,740
对，我就这意思。
Ah,that's what I meant.

316
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,830
所以我得干我非干不可的事。
So,now I have to do what I have to do.

317
00:15:05,830 --> 00:15:07,160
可以。
Right.

318
00:15:09,380 --> 00:15:11,400
Ben，要是你想免除痛苦，
Look,Ben. If you want to save yourself a lot of grief,

319
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,930
千万别让爸爸妈妈对你抱太多指望，
don't let mom and dad expect great things from you.

320
00:15:12,930 --> 00:15:15,110
让他们知道你是不可救药的。
Let them know your a real disappointment now.

321
00:15:59,450 --> 00:16:00,980
Maggie!

322
00:16:02,990 --> 00:16:04,490
Jason!

323
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,710
你在啊
Oh,you're here.

324
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:14,800
Maggie!

325
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:16,280
Jason!

326
00:16:20,730 --> 00:16:21,710
我以为你去开门了。
Thought you were gonna answer.

327
00:16:21,710 --> 00:16:23,500
我以为你去开了。
I thought you were.

328
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:26,970
知道你们在家，我听见声音了。
I know you are in there. I can hear you.

329
00:16:26,970 --> 00:16:28,580
你好。
Hello?

330
00:16:29,700 --> 00:16:31,770
HI，我是Terry，Mike在家吗？
Hi! I'm Terry,is Mike home?

331
00:16:31,770 --> 00:16:32,890
不在。
No.

332
00:16:34,220 --> 00:16:35,580
他的制服在家吗？
Is his burger uniform home?

333
00:16:36,940 --> 00:16:38,580
没有，他穿着呢。
No,he's wearing it.

334
00:16:39,300 --> 00:16:40,900
噢，那太让人伤心了。
Oh,that is so sad.

335
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:44,850
Terry，我是治精神病的。
Terry,I'm a psychiatrist.

336
00:16:44,850 --> 00:16:48,820
不，我现在是汉堡包房的经理助理，
Well,I,I'm the new assistant manager at World of Burgers,

337
00:16:49,260 --> 00:16:50,700
我需要那件制服。
and I need his uniform.

338
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:52,760
Mike也需要。
Oh,well,Mike needs it.

339
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:53,460
为什么？
For what?

340
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,120
为上班！
For work.

341
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,400
真是好极了！
That's great!

342
00:16:56,900 --> 00:17:00,120
他被解雇我都快伤心死了。
I felt so bad when he got fired. Well,

343
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:00,540
等一下。
Hold it!

344
00:17:00,740 --> 00:17:01,640
什么等一下？
Hold what?

345
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:04,020
Mike被解雇了？
Mike was fired?

346
00:17:05,300 --> 00:17:06,260
你不知道？
You didn't know?

347
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:10,500
天啊，我又闯祸了！
O,boy! I did it again.

348
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:13,090
好象是Mike又闯祸了！
Seems like Mike did it again.

349
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:16,340
我撒谎了。他没有被解雇。
I lied. Ah,he didn't get fired.

350
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,510
听着，我根本就不认识他，
Look,I,I don't even know him.

351
00:17:19,380 --> 00:17:22,280
我是个精神失常的人，就喜欢收集制服。
I'm just an insane girl who collects Burger uniforms.

352
00:17:22,280 --> 00:17:25,950
呃……就算我没来过这，好吗？
Ah,just forget I ever came by here,Ok?

353
00:17:26,900 --> 00:17:29,640
根本没那事。好吧，再见。
This never happened. So,bye,bye!

354
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:44,660
HI，爸爸？一对一怎么样？
Hey,dad! How about some one on one?

355
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:46,440
现在我正忙着呢，Ben。
No. I'm too busy right now,Ben.

356
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:48,680
忙着干什么？
Doing what?

357
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:52,420
我在忙着把我的愤怒情绪升华，
I'm sublimating my angers so I get my negative emotions under control

358
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:54,900
把消极情绪转化为比较积极的情绪，懂了吗？
and have a more constructive attitude,Ok?

359
00:17:57,140 --> 00:17:59,000
噢，祝你成功！
Oh! Good luck!

360
00:18:00,940 --> 00:18:01,190
HI，妈妈。
Hi,Mom

361
00:18:01,190 --> 00:18:02,010
Hi.

362
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:04,100
他正忙着呢。
He's busy.

363
00:18:07,580 --> 00:18:08,700
你说对了。
You were right.

364
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:09,580
对什么？
I was?

365
00:18:10,180 --> 00:18:12,020
咱们不应该让Mike去打工。
We never should have let Mike take that job.

366
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:14,560
OH，Jason，我倒希望我说错了。
Oh,Jason. I didn't want to be right about that.

367
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:18,380
你瞧这，来吧，看见了什么？
Look at this. Look. What do you see here?

368
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:20,800
是一滩油迹。
A grease spot.

369
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:23,260
这不仅是一滩油迹。
It's not just a grease spot.

370
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,090
他象征着我上了当，
This is a symbol of my gullibility.

371
00:18:25,090 --> 00:18:28,180
一个值两千六百美元的当。大当。
A 26 hundred dollars symbol of my gullibility.

372
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:32,640
加税款，执照费和佣金总数就是这些。
Plus tax,license and dealer prep,whatever the hell that is.

373
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,530
亲爱的，我不认为你上了当，因为……
Oh,honey. I wouldn't call you gulable,I'd say you were...

374
00:18:35,530 --> 00:18:36,640
愚蠢，对吗？
Stupid?

375
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:37,940
我是说你很信任人。
Well,I was going to say trusting.

376
00:18:39,140 --> 00:18:41,060
对Mike信任等于愚蠢。
Well,with Mike,trust is stupid.

377
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,860
亲爱的，信任Carol是容易的，
Oh,honey. Trusting Carol is easy,

378
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:46,480
Ben也不成问题，因为
and Ben's no problem because,well,

379
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:49,610
他是家里最小的一个。可是信任Mike就需要……
he's smaller than us. But trusting Mike is a real…

380
00:18:49,610 --> 00:18:51,620
请不要说愚蠢两个字了。
Ah,very good. You're back to stupidity again.

381
00:18:52,580 --> 00:18:54,080
我再也不信任Mike了，Maggie！
I'm not trusting him any more,Maggie.

382
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:56,680
Jason，他辜负了我们的信任，可是……
Jason,I know he let us down,but maybe there is some…

383
00:18:56,680 --> 00:19:00,320
他骗了我们整整一个星期，只是为了保住他的那辆车。
Oh,you know,he lied to us for a solid week just so he wouldn't lose that car.

384
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:04,060
我倒真想看看，Mike几时能考虑一下别人。
And I really sick of Mike thinking of nobody but himself first.

385
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,390
你这么大的火最好现在别去跟他谈。
you know,Jason. Maybe you shouldn't talk to him when you're this angry.

386
00:19:09,390 --> 00:19:10,510
一点也不错。
Absolutely.

387
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:14,350
可你会。
But you will.

388
00:19:14,350 --> 00:19:18,250
一点也不错。
Absolutely.

389
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:29,940
HI，爸爸。
Hey Dad!

390
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:35,420
这不会是我那工作努力的儿子和他得之无愧的汽车吧？
Well,if it isn't my hard working son and his well deserved car?

391
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:37,060
是的，都是的。
Yeah,that's us,Dad.

392
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:38,810
我都快要累坏了。爸爸。
You know I'm really bushed today,Dad.

393
00:19:38,810 --> 00:19:41,170
汉堡包房今天怎么了？
So how you go down at the World of Burgers?

394
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:43,040
看上去像是弄了点洋葱
Looks like you got some onion.

395
00:19:43,100 --> 00:19:46,130
我老实对你说吧。
Yeah,well,to tell you the truth,Dad.

396
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:48,020
对我说？什么？
Excuse me,the what?

397
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:50,480
说老实话，嗯，
Tell you the truth. Ah,

398
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:54,560
我在汉堡包房受了点挫折。
I don't know,I'm getting a little bummed with WOB

399
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:56,720
你不是这个月的明星职工吗？
Oh,but you're the employee of the month.

400
00:19:56,720 --> 00:19:59,120
可也给我带来了很大的压力。
Yeah,you know,there's a lot of pressure there,dad,

401
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:02,570
他们想让我去给经理当助理，
and I don't know. They are talking about making me an assistant manager.

402
00:20:02,570 --> 00:20:06,730
那样我得先去上汉堡包大学了。
That would mean i'd have to go to burger college

403
00:20:06,730 --> 00:20:10,250
可我吃不准是不是上大学的料的。
and I just don't know if I'm university material.

404
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:14,000
这么说，你已经打算辞掉这份的工作啰。
So you're telling me that you're considering quitting this job?

405
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:18,540
我在排队等一个更好的差事。
Well,I've already got a better job to lined up,Dad.

406
00:20:18,540 --> 00:20:21,720
这是一个汽车工业的活。
Yes,in the auto-motive industry.

407
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:25,650
福特，通用，还是克莱斯勒？
Ah! Ford? General motors? Crysler?

408
00:20:25,650 --> 00:20:26,820
波尼
Burney.

409
00:20:26,820 --> 00:20:28,810
波尼？
Burney?

410
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:31,280
对，波尼洗车公司，我要当一名洗车工，
Yeah,Burney's car wash. I want to be a rag man,Dad.

411
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:33,150
酬金丰厚，前途灿烂。
Tips galore and a great future.

412
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:40,860
完了，说不下去了，
Oh,I can't do this.

413
00:20:41,620 --> 00:20:44,860
对你我就不能当面说谎，因为你有特异功能。
I can't look you in the face and lie. What is it,some kind of magic power?

414
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:47,780
Mike，我……
Mike,I have…

415
00:20:47,780 --> 00:20:48,400
爸爸，我被解雇了。
Dad,I got fired.

416
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:51,510
甚至都不是我的错
Ok,it wasn't even my fault. Dad,I mean,

417
00:20:52,700 --> 00:20:54,340
我为了掩护一个叫Terry的姑娘,她把收银机一直开着
I was covering for this girl named Terry who left her register draw open.

418
00:20:56,460 --> 00:21:00,960
我本来想告诉你的。可那天你正好送我汽车。
Sorry,I wanted to tell you but I guess that was the day you gave me this car.

419
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:02,740
你叫我怎么对你开口呢。
What was I supposed to say then?

420
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:04,430
对，你不希望失去你的车。
Oh,yes. You didn't want to risk losing the car.

421
00:21:04,430 --> 00:21:06,880
爸爸，我不是为了那辆车。
Oh,dad. It wasn't because of the car.

422
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:11,600
我是说是的，但不是你说的意思……
I mean,it was,but not the way you mean.

423
00:21:12,860 --> 00:21:13,700
那天，我是破天荒第一次
It was just such a new experience,I mean,

424
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:15,460
让你为我感到自豪，
how could you be so proud of me?

425
00:21:21,740 --> 00:21:22,800
我都搞糊涂了。
It confused me.

426
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:22,900
我也被搞糊涂了。
Well,it confused me,too.

427
00:21:24,020 --> 00:21:25,860
你还不明白吗？
So don't you see,dad? I mean,

428
00:21:25,860 --> 00:21:27,980
我是不愿意让你认为我是个不可信赖
I just didn't want you to think I was some loser

429
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:30,000
甚至是不可救药的人。
who couldn't be trust with any responsibility.

430
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:31,580
正当你开始信任我时。
Just when you started having faith in me.

431
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:33,970
你对我也应该有点信心。
Well,you've got to have a little faith in me,too.

432
00:21:35,380 --> 00:21:36,560
算了吧，爸爸。
Oh,come on,dad,no.

433
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:39,240
要是你发现我已经被人解雇了，你会在这团团转，
If you had somehow found out that I was fired,

434
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:42,780
对妈妈说信任我有多么愚蠢。
you'd be out here pacing,telling mom how stupid you were to trust me.

435
00:21:46,260 --> 00:21:47,270
你这样说也许也可能。
Well,possibly we may…

436
00:21:47,270 --> 00:21:50,240
爸爸，你要知道
Dad,don't you see,you know

437
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:53,280
向你隐瞒真相我有多么的难受。
how hard it's been for me to keep the truth from you?

438
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:55,960
你隐瞒是为了我？
So you lied to me for me?

439
00:21:56,760 --> 00:21:59,140
对，我不能辜负你对我的信任，
Yeah,I just didn't wanna let you down.

440
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:01,400
不管发生什么事都不能。
No matter what happened to me it didn't matter.

441
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:04,880
这点我很赞赏。
Well,I appreciate that.

442
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:12,570
Mike，我们一定在等你。
Michael? We've been waiting for you.

443
00:22:12,570 --> 00:22:16,720
Maggie，Mike对我说他的那份工作一星期前就丢了。
And Maggie,Mike just told me he lost his job at the Burger place last week.

444
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:18,400
他说了？
Oh he did.

445
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,040
我真是大吃一惊！
I was shocked.

446
00:22:22,260 --> 00:22:26,620
怎么会？Jason，他瞒了我们整整一个星期！
You were? Jason,he's been lying to us for an entire week!

447
00:22:27,180 --> 00:22:31,320
是的。真是个了不起的孩子。
Yes. Is that a great kid or what?

448
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:45,260
反正由于错误的理由干下的错事和
So there's a difference between doing the wrong thing for the wrong reason,

449
00:22:45,260 --> 00:22:47,080
由于正确的理由干的错事是有区别的。
and the wrong thing for the right reason.

450
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:48,860
有问题吗？
Any questions?

451
00:22:48,860 --> 00:22:50,700
没有。
No,no,no.

452
00:22:50,700 --> 00:22:51,960
很好。
Ok.

453
00:22:51,960 --> 00:22:54,820
等一下，我有个问题。
but,wait,I have a question.

454
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:59,360
上个月我打碎了妈妈珍贵的瓷器，
Last month I broke some of mom's good china,

455
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:02,680
可我为什么没有得到奖赏呢？
how come I didn't get a reward for it?

456
00:23:02,980 --> 00:23:08,350
可你要知道世界上有错误的事，也有正确的事。
See there're wrong things and there're right things.

457
00:23:09,700 --> 00:23:13,180
错误的不正确的事总是不应该得到原谅的。
Now the wrong things sometimes do...
